msgstr "YAML (caadi)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Dejinta SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Ogolaanshahaaga qalabku ma daboolayo qalab kasta, markaa ma dhoofin kartid ama ma soo dejin kartid dejinta SmokePing. Weydii maamule leh gelitaanka dhammaan qalabka."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Dhoofi Dejinta SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Dhoofintu waxay haysaa dejimaha plugin-ka, bartilmaameedyada SmokePing ee plugin-ku akhriyay, iyo qalabka mid walba lagu xidhay, iyadoo loo eegayo magaca martida iyo sharraxaadda qalabka. Ma hayso il xog, jaantus, fayl RRD, ama aqoonsi sir ah."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Soo deji"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Soo deji Dejinta SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Doorashada faylku way hubisaa oo keliya. Shaashadda xigta waxay taxdaa isbeddel kasta oo faylku samayn lahaa, waxbana lama qoro ilaa aad xaqiijiso liiskaas. Soo-dejintu way ku dartaa wayna cusboonaysiisaa; weligeed ma tirtirto bartilmaameed ama ma rarto xidhmo, weligeedna ma abuurto fayl RRD ama ma taabato galka xogta SmokePing."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Hubi Faylka"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Hubinta Soo-dejinta"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Waxba lama qorin."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Dib u noqo"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Faylka lama soo dejin karo ilaa khaladaadkan la saxo. Waxba lama qorin."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Rakibaadda hore ayay ula mid tahay faylka. Ma jiro wax la soo dejiyo."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Qorshaha %s. Dhaqan-gelintu waxay samaysaa isbeddelladan oo dhan hal mar. Haddii faylka ama rakibaadda isbeddeleen tan iyo hubintan, soo-dejinta waa la diidaa waxaadna hubisaa mar kale."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Dhaqan-geli Soo-dejinta"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Jooji"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Ku dar Bartilmaameedyada SmokePing"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "ma jiro bartilmaameed SmokePing oo u dhigma"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Guji Sii wad si aad ugu darto bartilmaameedyada SmokePing ee martigaliyohoodu yahay magaca martida ee qalab kasta oo la doortay. Bartilmaameed kasta wuxuu helaa jaantus kooban oo digniinta ah, iyo marka xogta SmokePing la sawiri karo, jaantus qiiq ah. Qalabka halkan laguma abuuro."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "%d bartilmaameed ayaa u dhigma."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "%d shay ayaa la abuuray ama la xidhay, %d waa la dhaafay."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Qalabkani wuxuu leeyahay bartilmaameedyada SmokePing, laakiin akhristaha buuxiya qiimahooda kooban wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa poller %d qalabkana waxaa lagu kaydiyay poller %d. Qiimayaasha kooban iyo digniinaha way istaagaan ilaa qalabka mar kale loo qoondeeyo poller %d."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Bartilmaameedyada SmokePing ee Qalabkan"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "%d jaantusyo qiiq ah ayaa weli sawira midabada kale; poller-ka weyn wuxuu guuraa ilaa 200 meertadiiba."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "%d jaantusyo qiiq ah lama guurin karin; orod upgrade-graphs si aad mar kale isugu daydo, oo ka eeg diiwaanka Cacti sababta."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Dejinta Loss Colors waxay codsanaysaa midabada luminta ee SmokePing %s, laakiin akhristuhu wuxuu helay SmokePing %s. Ku deji Automatic haddii aanay jaantusyadu ka duwanaanayn kuwa SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Dejinta Loss Colors waxay u doorataa midabada luminta ee SmokePing %s jaantusyada qiiqa."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Akhristuhu ma helin nooca SmokePing, markaa dejinta Loss Colors waxay doorataa midabada luminta ee SmokePing 2.8 iyo wixii ka dambeeya. Haddii SmokePing yahay 2.7, ku deji Loss Colors SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Akhristuhu wuxuu helay SmokePing %s, markaa dejinta Loss Colors waxay doorataa midabadiisa luminta."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Thold lama rakibin, markaa ma jiro bartilmaameed ka diga labada SmokePing iyo Thold."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Ma jiro bartilmaameed leh labadaba digniinta SmokePing iyo xadka Thold ee shidan."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "%d bartilmaameed waxay leeyihiin labadaba digniinta SmokePing iyo xadka Thold ee shidan, markaa hal dhibaato waxay ogeysiin kartaa laba jeer. Isbarbar dhig shuruudahooda digniinta ka hor intaadan midna ka saarin: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Qaababka SmokePing way ku guuldarraysteen inay soo degaan si toos ahna dib looguma isku dayo: %s Isticmaal Retry Template Import ka dib marka la saxo sababta."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Qaababka SmokePing lama soo dejin. Isticmaal Retry Template Import."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "Qaababka SmokePing waa la soo dejiyay."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Qalab kasta oo leh ilaha xogta kooban waxaa codka ka qaada poller-ka akhristaha."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "%d qalab waxay leeyihiin ilaha xogta kooban laakiin kama cod-qaado poller %d, kaas oo wada akhristaha, markaa qiimahooda kooban iyo digniinahoodu xog ma leh: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "Dejinta SmokePing waxaa lagu akhriyaa poller %d, ee maaha server-kan; safka diiwaanka alaabta wuxuu muujinayaa natiijada akhriskii ugu dambeeyay."

