#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Faylka SmokePing ee la dejiyay waxaa lala akhriyaa faylasha uu ku daro, iyadoo laga soo qaado galkiisa. Faylka la soo geliyay keligiis ayaa la akhriyaa: @include looma ogola gudihiisa."

