#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Kaliya geed cusub. Geed hore u leh magacan ayaa la isticmaalaa."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Horudhacu wuxuu akhriyaa dejinta wuxuuna taxaa waxa soo-dejintu abuuri lahayd. Waxba lama qoro ilaa aad xaqiijiso liiskaas shaashadda xigta, faylasha SmokePing laftoodana weligood lama qoro."

