#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Source"
msgstr "Isha SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "Poller-ka SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Poller-ka Cacti ee ka shaqeeya, ama la wadaaga nidaamka faylasha, martigeliyaha SmokePing. Kaliya poller-kan ayaa akhriya xogta SmokePing."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration File"
msgstr "Faylka Dejinta SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Faylka ugu weyn ee dejinta SmokePing, oo uu akhriyo poller-ka wada akhriyaha. Kordhintu waxay ku akhridaa isaga iyo faylasha uu ku daro falanqeeye u gaar ah, mana qorto weligeed. Faylasha lagu daray waa inay ku jiraan galka faylkan gudihiisa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "Galka Xogta SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "Galka xogta (datadir) ee ka yimid dejinta SmokePing, sida SmokePing u arko."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Ku-xidhka Cacti ee Galka Xogta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "Ku-xidh akhris-kaliya (bind ama NFS) oo ah galka xogta SmokePing ee ku dhex jira waddada RRA ee Cacti. Cacti wuxuu kaliya akhriyaa faylasha RRD ee ku dhex jira waddadiisa RRA, mana maro xidhiidh-tilmaan (symlink)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Akhriye"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Miisaaniyadda Waqtiga Akhriyaha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend reading RRD files before it stops and resumes on the next poller cycle."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada uu hal hawl-akhriye ku bixin karo akhrinta faylasha RRD ka hor inta uusan istaagin oo uusan dib uga bilaaban wareegga poller-ka xiga."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Inventory Interval"
msgstr "Muddada U Dhexeysa Tirakoobka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Minimum seconds between inventory runs. The inventory also runs when the configuration file changes."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada ugu yar ee u dhexeeya hawlaha tirakoobka. Tirakoobku wuxuu sidoo kale shaqeeyaa marka faylka dejintu isbeddelo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness Allowance"
msgstr "Oggolaanshaha Cusboonaanta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds past one step for which a measurement still counts as current."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada dhaafsiisan hal tallaabo oo cabbirku weli u xisaabmo mid hadda ah."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Loss Colors"
msgstr "Midabada Lumidda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Which SmokePing loss colors the smoke graphs draw. SmokePing 2.7 draws other loss levels than 2.8 and later. Automatic follows the SmokePing version the reader finds next to SmokePing, shown on the health page, and uses 2.8 and later when it finds none."
msgstr "Midabada lumidda SmokePing ee ay sawiraan garaafyada smoke. SmokePing 2.7 wuxuu sawiraa heerar lumid oo ka duwan 2.8 iyo wixii ka dambeeya. Toos ah (Automatic) wuxuu raacaa nooca SmokePing ee akhriyuhu ka helo SmokePing agtiisa, kaas oo ka muuqda bogga caafimaadka, wuxuuna adeegsadaa 2.8 iyo wixii ka dambeeya marka uusan waxba helin."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Toos ah"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.8 and later"
msgstr "SmokePing 2.8 iyo wixii ka dambeeya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.7"
msgstr "SmokePing 2.7"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Ka saar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Ilaali Jadwalka Plugin-ka Marka La Saarayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its inventory, mapping, and health tables. SmokePing files are never removed either way."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadeeyo, ka-saarista kordhintu waxay ilaalisaa miisaskeeda tirakoobka, ku-meelaynta, iyo caafimaadka. Faylasha SmokePing weligood lama tirtiro labada xaaladoodba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Backup Directory"
msgstr "Galka Kaydinta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Where the uninstall writes its export of the plugin configuration. Leave blank to use the cache/smokeping directory of Cacti, which the plugin protects with a deny-all rule. A directory set here must already exist, be writable, and be outside the web root; when it is not writable no export is written."
msgstr "Meesha ay ka-saaristu ku qorto dhoofinta dejinta kordhinta. Bannaana u dhaaf si aad u isticmaasho galka cache/smokeping ee Cacti, kaas oo kordhintu ku ilaaliso xeerka diidmada dhammaan. Galka halkan lagu dejiyo waa inuu hore u jiro, la qori karo, kana baxsanaado xididka webka; marka aan la qori karin wax dhoofin ah lama qoro."

